   "source": [
    "## Task 2 – Feedforward neural network\n",
    "* Each image has shape `1×28×28`, so the input layer size is `D_in = 28*28 = 784` and the tensor is flattened in `forward`.\n",
    "* ReLU in the hidden layer, no convolutions.\n",
    "* `log_softmax` as output activation (pairs with the NLL loss)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d0619909",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
